, and the screen is maaaasssssiiiiiiiivvveee. A nice welcome to fast knowledgeable service & they go to every effort to accommodate your needs. After the large main room, there's a pool room off to one side & another more intimate balcony area upstairs. The atmosphere is not too loud, so you have to shout, and the other guests are all smiling and up to banter. The menu does not do justice to the food, which was excellent. A mix of burgers, etc, to more traditional dishes Generous portios, to say the least, could not even look at the desserts menu. A real gem * kids are welcome", "This was the best restaurant I've visited in Pula. Pavle, the server was extremely pleasant and welcoming, he gave some great suggestions. I came in only to have some coffee but ended up getting the breakfast and dessert. Couldn't tell which was better. Extremely well made food, with even better staff. I couldn't recommend this place more!"], "price": "medium"}}
